WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.750
[Deep house music] Six presales. Six admin panels. Six spreadsheets a day. No one sees the whole picture.

00:05.800 --> 00:08.660
Crypto Presales Dashboard. Every presale, one operations platform.

00:08.710 --> 00:17.360
Buyers pay in crypto or card. Live stage pricing, crypto or card checkout, referral and bonus codes.

00:17.410 --> 00:23.170
Every presale, one view. Role-based access. Switch presales in one click.

00:23.220 --> 00:31.870
Drill into any presale: stages, pricing, bonus codes.

00:31.920 --> 00:37.680
Each project's rules stay intact. Reads go direct with no data migration. Writes go through each project's own API.

00:37.730 --> 00:43.480
Real money ran through it: $410K+ raised across two live presales, $300K+ raised by one presale in two months.

00:43.530 --> 00:49.550
Crypto Presales Dashboard. Designed and built by Hidanz. Product design, web app, backend integration, two months.
